    <section id="rules-regulations">

        <!--Sub-Heading-->
        <div class="section-heading__title">
            <h4>Rules &amp; Regulations</h4>
        </div>

        <p>
            We here at Bright Nursing beleive that discipline and professionalism are one of necessary skills towards
            becoming a respected and successful healhcare professionals. These skills will not only help you in your
            career but also works towards making you into a overall complete individual. In order to maintain a
            repectful and enriching learning experience, students must adhere by to these following guidelines:
        </p>

        <ul class="li-bullet">
            <li>
                <strong>Scholastic Integrity and Professional Discipline
                </strong>
                <br>
                <span>
                    Students are expected to maintain
                    high academic standards and consistently uphold ethical values.
                </span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>
                    Prohibition of Misconduct
                </strong>
                <br>
                <span>
                    Any form of harassment, indiscipline or inappropiate
                    behaviour will lead to
                    strict action, including suspension or expulsion where warranted.
                </span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>
                    Green Campus &amp; Environmental Responsibility
                </strong>
                <br>
                <span>
                    Students are to use the designated
                    waste disposal facilities and refrain from littering to actively contribute towards maintaining a
                    clean
                    and hygeinic campus.
                </span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Respect College Property </strong>
                <br>
                <span>
                    All infrastrcuture, equipment, books and facilities must be handled with utmost care. Damage to
                    isntutional property will result in appropiate disciplinary measures.
                </span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>
                    Regulated Use of Electronic Devices
                </strong>
                <br>
                <span>
                    Unauthorized use of mobile phones or electronic devices within the campus premises is strictly
                    prohibited.
                </span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

